0	section	Standard dialogue
1	line	Miss Schism	Oooh, my dear, have you heard the news?
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Ok, tell me about the news.
2	cond	If the player has watched the bank robbery cutscene:
3	line	Player	Ok, tell me about the news.
3	line	Miss Schism	It's terrible, absolutely terrible! Those poor people!
3	line	Player	Ok, yeah.
3	line	Miss Schism	And who'd have ever thought such a sweet old gentleman would do such a thing?
3	line	Player	Are we talking about the bank robbery?
3	line	Miss Schism	Oh yes, my dear. It was terrible! TERRIBLE!
3	line	Miss Schism	But tell me - have you been around here before, or are you new to these parts?
3	select	Select an option
3	option	I'm quite new.
4	line	Player	I'm quite new.
4	line	Miss Schism	Aah, perhaps you missed the excitement. It's that old man in this house here. Do you know him?
4	line	Player	Well, I know of him.
4	line	Miss Schism	When he first moved here, he didn't bring much. From the window you could see he just had some old furniture and a few dusty ornaments.
4	line	Miss Schism	Here, look at this picture:
4	line	Miss Schism	Also he always seemed so poor. When I went round to collect donations for the Draynor Manor Restoration Fund, he couldn't spare them a penny!
4	line	Player	So he's redecorated?
4	line	Miss Schism	Well, just you look in there now!
4	line	Miss Schism	You see? It's full of jewellery and decorations! And all those expensive things appeared just after the bank got robbed.
4	line	Miss Schism	He changed his hat too - he used to wear a scruffy old black thing, but suddenly he was wearing that party hat!
4	line	Player	So that's why you're telling people he was the bank robber?
4	line	Miss Schism	Oooh, my dear, I'm SURE of it! I went upstairs in his house once, while he was out walking, and do you know what I found?
4	line	Player	A sign saying 'Trespassers will be prosecuted'?
4	line	Miss Schism	No, it was a telescope! It was pointing right at the bank! He was spying on the bankers, planning the big robbery!
4	line	Miss Schism	I bet if you go and look through it now, you'll find it's pointing somewhere different now he's finished with the bank.
4	line	Player	I'd like to go now.
4	line	Miss Schism	Oh, really? Well, do keep an eye on him - I just KNOW he's planning something...
4	action	end
3	option	I've been around here for ages.
