1	option	Who are you?
2	line	Player	Who are you?
2	line	Miss Schism	I, my dear, am a concerned citizen of Draynor Village. Ever since the Council allowed those farmers to set up their stalls here, we've had a constant flow of thieves and murderers through our fair village, and I decided
2	line	Miss Schism	that someone HAD to stand up and keep an eye on the situation.
2	line	Miss Schism	I also do voluntary work for the Draynor Manor Restoration Fund. We're campaigning to have Draynor Manor turned into a museum before the wet-rot destroys it completely.
2	line	Player	Right...
2	action	other
1	option	I'm not talking to you, you horrible woman.
